      {
        "id": "tb-composite-definition",
        "moduleId": "composite-matrix",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "复合变换矩阵的定义",
        "markdown": "如果对同一坐标位置依次施加多个变换，不必每次都单独调用变换。利用矩阵表达式，可以先把各个单变换矩阵相乘，得到一个**复合变换矩阵**（composite transformation matrix）。形成矩阵乘积的过程常称为矩阵的**合并**（concatenation）或**复合**（composition）。\n\n由于一个坐标位置用齐次列矩阵表示，变换矩阵必须**前乘**该列矩阵。若对点 $P$ 先施加 $\\mathbf{M}_1$，再施加 $\\mathbf{M}_2$，则\n\n$$\\mathbf{P}' = \\mathbf{M}_2 \\cdot \\mathbf{M}_1 \\cdot \\mathbf{P} = \\mathbf{M} \\cdot \\mathbf{P}$$\n\n其中 $\\mathbf{M} = \\mathbf{M}_2 \\cdot \\mathbf{M}_1$。注意乘法从右向左作用：最靠近 $P$ 的矩阵最先作用于点。\n\n场景中大量位置往往按同一顺序变换，因此先算好复合矩阵再逐点相乘，比每个点重复执行整个变换序列高效得多。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000229"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "二维复合变换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6002,
              "lineEnd": 6011,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "1f9b1ac58f493f7599ba22c3de5de186ffa6b5b31ce735ca8029be8bb9529fa1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-order-why",
        "moduleId": "composite-matrix",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：为什么顺序要从右往左读",
        "markdown": "先算复合矩阵，等于把“变换多少次”的开销从每个点转移到整条序列上。\n\n直观上可以把列矩阵乘法读成“从右往左套函数”：$\\mathbf{M}_2 \\cdot \\mathbf{M}_1 \\cdot \\mathbf{P}$ 表示先让 $\\mathbf{M}_1$ 作用于 $P$，再让 $\\mathbf{M}_2$ 作用。因此书写时矩阵顺序与执行顺序相反，这一点是后续所有顺序错误的源头。\n\n复合矩阵不改变序列的几何效果，它只是把同一序列打包成一个 3×3 矩阵；若序列中途需要修改，必须重新计算复合矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-composite-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-translation-composite",
        "moduleId": "same-type-composition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "复合二维平移",
        "markdown": "连续施加两个平移向量 $(t_{1x},t_{1y})$ 与 $(t_{2x},t_{2y})$，其复合矩阵把两次平移量相加：\n\n$$\\mathbf{T}(t_{2x},t_{2y}) \\cdot \\mathbf{T}(t_{1x},t_{1y}) = \\mathbf{T}(t_{1x}+t_{2x},\\ t_{1y}+t_{2y})$$\n\n矩阵形式为\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix}1&0&t_{2x}\\\\0&1&t_{2y}\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1&0&t_{1x}\\\\0&1&t_{1y}\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1&0&t_{1x}+t_{2x}\\\\0&1&t_{1y}+t_{2y}\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n可见连续平移是可交换的：先把哪个平移量加上去，最终位置都一样。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000230"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "复合二维平移"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6012,
              "lineEnd": 6033,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a2dd48d12a632b20fdb8a0e752f0e22824d5bb02af8219dc2e37dc7ae958d395"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-translation-example",
        "moduleId": "same-type-composition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "补充算例：两段平移",
        "markdown": "例如先把点平移 $(2,3)$，再平移 $(-1,5)$。复合平移向量为 $(2+(-1),\\ 3+5)=(1,8)$，所以点 $(4,1)$ 的最终位置是 $(4+1,\\ 1+8)=(5,9)$。\n\n分两步走也会得到相同结果：第一步到 $(6,4)$，第二步到 $(5,9)$。这说明平移的复合只是参数相加，与两段平移的先后无关。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-translation-composite"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-rotation-composite",
        "moduleId": "same-type-composition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "复合二维旋转",
        "markdown": "两次旋转的复合矩阵同样是参数相加：\n\n$$\\mathbf{R}(\\theta_2) \\cdot \\mathbf{R}(\\theta_1) = \\mathbf{R}(\\theta_1+\\theta_2)$$\n\n因此点旋转后的坐标为\n\n$$\\mathbf{P}' = \\mathbf{R}(\\theta_1+\\theta_2) \\cdot \\mathbf{P}$$\n\n旋转矩阵相乘可借助三角恒等式展开，结果恰好是角度为 $\\theta_1+\\theta_2$ 的旋转矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000231"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "复合二维旋转"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6034,
              "lineEnd": 6053,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "bdce8b76320590e654a85f7372f7d54a9f59d58da6502aee76eefa6992a7ece8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-rotation-sum-note",
        "moduleId": "same-type-composition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：三类同类复合的对照",
        "markdown": "把三类变换放在一起比较：\n\n- 平移复合：参数**相加**；旋转复合：角度**相加**；缩放复合：参数**相乘**。\n- 同类变换连续执行时可交换顺序；但“平移 + 旋转”一般不能交换，下一模块会给出反例。\n- 角度相加后对 $360^\\circ$ 取模不改变旋转矩阵，因为 $\\cos$ 与 $\\sin$ 以 $360^\\circ$ 为周期。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-rotation-composite",
            "tb-translation-composite"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-scaling-composite",
        "moduleId": "same-type-composition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "复合二维缩放",
        "markdown": "两次缩放复合后，缩放系数相乘：\n\n$$\\mathbf{S}(s_{2x},s_{2y}) \\cdot \\mathbf{S}(s_{1x},s_{1y}) = \\mathbf{S}(s_{1x}s_{2x},\\ s_{1y}s_{2y})$$\n\n矩阵形式为\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix}s_{2x}&0&0\\\\0&s_{2y}&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}s_{1x}&0&0\\\\0&s_{1y}&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}s_{1x}s_{2x}&0&0\\\\0&s_{1y}s_{2y}&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n因此连续两次把对象放大 3 倍，最终尺寸是原来的 $3\\times3=9$ 倍。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000232"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "复合二维缩放"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6054,
              "lineEnd": 6069,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "6f5b0dba9d08bae2530b91fc8b15be31b2bb5dfd5c23e85d227e519e53784e17"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-scaling-example",
        "moduleId": "same-type-composition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "补充算例：系数相乘",
        "markdown": "若先以 $s_{1x}=2,\\ s_{1y}=3$ 缩放，再以 $s_{2x}=0.5,\\ s_{2y}=2$ 缩放，复合缩放系数为 $(2\\times0.5,\\ 3\\times2)=(1,6)$。\n\n这表示 x 方向最终没有净缩放，而 y 方向被拉长 6 倍。注意这里是系数**相乘**而不是相加，与平移的参数相加形成对照。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-scaling-composite"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-pivot-rotation",
        "moduleId": "pivot-and-directional",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "通用二维基准点旋转",
        "markdown": "图形库通常只提供绕坐标原点的旋转。若要绕任意基准点 $(x_r,y_r)$ 旋转，可按三步构造复合变换：\n\n1. 平移对象，把基准点移到坐标原点；\n2. 绕坐标原点旋转角 $\\theta$；\n3. 反向平移，把基准点送回原位置。\n\n这三步的矩阵合并为\n\n$$\\mathbf{T}(x_r,y_r) \\cdot \\mathbf{R}(\\theta) \\cdot \\mathbf{T}(-x_r,-y_r) = \\mathbf{R}(x_r,y_r,\\theta)$$\n\n展开后得到\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix}\\cos\\theta&-\\sin\\theta&x_r(1-\\cos\\theta)+y_r\\sin\\theta\\\\ \\sin\\theta&\\cos\\theta&y_r(1-\\cos\\theta)-x_r\\sin\\theta\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n其中反向平移矩阵满足 $\\mathbf{T}^{-1}(x_r,y_r)=\\mathbf{T}(-x_r,-y_r)$。许多图形库直接把基准点作为旋转函数的参数，内部自动生成该矩阵。图 7.9 以（a）原始位置、（b）平移到原点、（c）绕原点旋转、（d）平移回原位四步展示了这一顺序。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000233"
              ],
